					"content": "哦，這上面是我們之前看過的塗鴉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330806,
					"content": "現在非常難買，我排了好久的隊才買到，哈哈哈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330807,
					"content": "我也有件畫著這個塗鴉的衣服，我掛在床頭了，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330808,
						150330810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330808,
					"content": "沒錯，正是大名鼎鼎的我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330809
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150330809,
					"content": "#下次麻煩{F#妳}{M#你}幫我的衣服簽名吧，我會珍藏起來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330812,
					"content": "#對了，{F#妳}{M#你}們來這裡，有什麼安排嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150330810,
					"content": "有點不好意思…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150330811,
					"content": "#哈哈哈，受歡迎是件好事啊，這是{F#妳}{M#你}應有的待遇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150330812
					],
